program	exclusivity_move_and_ref.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot `move` `x` while it is also passed by reference in the same call
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: use of moved variable `x`"
log	"  --> examples/exclusivity_move_and_ref.saw:16:16"
log	"     |"
log	" 16 |     f(move x, &x)"
log	"     |                ^"
log	"   hint: value was moved at line 16 and can no longer be used"
log	""
log	"error: cannot `move` `x` while it is also passed by reference in the same call"
log	"  --> examples/exclusivity_move_and_ref.saw:16:7"
log	"     |"
log	" 16 |     f(move x, &x)"
log	"     |       ^"
log	"   hint: a moved value cannot alias a reference argument in the same call"
log	""
log	"2 error(s) generated"
